        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Figure 2 - Strategy pattern applied to the write-format behaviour (proposed design). Realization (dashed, hollow triangle): each concrete strategy implements the FormatStrategy interface. Aggregation (open diamond): the context holds a FormatStrategy and delegates to it, and also holds WriteConfig and reads its stored format to choose the strategy - consistent with the system class diagram." vertex="1">
